aper Club, he finds himself caught in the crossfire between three pretty panelists assigned to the Life Advice column. Rino Endo has a mind for science, Fumi Kujo loves literature, and Izumi Suzuki covers the world of sports. If students have questions that need answers, these are the girls to ask, but cute as they may be, these panelists never seem to agree on anything! Needless to say, navigating life in the 2nd Newspaper Club is gonna be more than poor Yuki bargained for!","popularity":4.2561,"poster_path":"/qqLOaOxGI3L8InijYL44FXjjsIP.jpg","first_air_date":"2014-07-06","softcore":false,"name":"JINSEI - Life Consulting","vote_average":4.8,"vote_count":8},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/onX2K0PQq275H9TbW4QRqkGrqNK.jpg","genre_ids":[16,35],"id":94572,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"SUPER SHIRO","overview":"The Nohara family dog Shiro becomes a superhero and protects the legendary bone \"Bobobobobone\" from the evil inventor dog Dekapoo and his ambitions of world domination.","popularity":10.0205,"poster_path":"/iDYOQEXxAx3t8sJXABVSNbwQfwh.jpg","first_air_date":"2020-04-23","softcore":false,"name":"Super Shiro","vote_average":7,"vote_count":4},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/wijT08uoWpgJRKYEBfP9b9IFOQx.jpg","genre_ids":[16,35,10762],"id":29788,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"陸上防衛隊まおちゃん","overview":"Three eight-year-old girls, Mao, Misora and Sylvia, try to defend the earth against invading aliens. The world's defense has fallen to unlikely straits because the aliens are excessively cute, of which combat engagements are televised: if the forces battling the aliens were not cute themselves, the general public would revolt, as it would be seen as \"bullying\". Consequently, three military leaders chose their granddaughters to be the defenders, fittingly, becoming a team even cuter than the aliens. They each have a clover-shaped badge that enables them to transform.","popularity":4.9446,"poster_path":"/hxh39fEZFL7YXlxF5ZCmXXxnppW.jpg","first_air_date":"2002-07-03","softcore":false,"name":"Ground Defense Force! Mao-chan","vote_average":6.3,"vote_count":6},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/muHYgLHUNcOYF6yoHwYh0ASZKNC.jpg","genre_ids":[16,35],"id":94631,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"放課後ていぼう日誌","overview":"Hina Tsurugi and her family have just moved to a quaint seaside town. Hoping to savor the sight of the peaceful ocean, Hina stumbles upon a girl named Yuuki Kuroiwa—an upperclassman at her new school—who invites Hina to join her in fishing. Hina reels in an octopus, which falls onto her; being afraid of bugs and big creatures, she panics and begs Yuuki to remove it from her. Yuuki sees this as an opportunity to force Hina to join the school's Breakwater Club—a club where members gather, catch, and eat various types of marine life as their main activity. Although her attempts to refuse to join fail, Hina slowly begins to discover the hidden joy in fishing. Her view on the sport changes, now looking forward to all the delightful experiences she can take part in alongside her fellow club members.","popularity":11.9659,"poster_path":"/htP11RpdXdOjPRsXjjpFsPU24gf.jpg","first_air_date":"2020-04-07","softcore":false,"name":"Diary of Our Days at the Breakwater","vote_average":8.2,"vote_count":23},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/nSyGCMkmahgCeMdfKFqfz9pJ2LQ.jpg","genre_ids":[16,18,10765,9648],"id":1087,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"serial experiments lain","overview":"Lain—driven by the abrupt suicide of a classmate—logs on to the Wired and promptly loses herself in a twisted mass of hallucinations, memories, and interconnected-psyches.","popularity":14.4531,"poster_path":"/3MQo7PPuntw8GaZrsBPZcJLJity.jpg","first_air_date":"1998-07-06","softcore":false,"name":"Serial Experiments Lain","vote_average":8.201,"vote_count":674},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/hwc6yz1XyYviF1T91GrtGsIaUyD.jpg","genre_ids":[80